{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't choose what game to play? Well this game is the game for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Games for the Table</u> is a game with many games inside So far, the game contains a handful of games: checkers, chess, a unique fusion of checkers and chess, and a version of the well-know game, Crazy Eights, in development currently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Week after week, updates will be posted to the game, either adding new games to play or updating the games already present. Though I am a full-time employee and attend school full time also, I will try my best to update the game with more content and fixes as fast as possible!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hello!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219090/37b7c0333803d99646879d99af426b83807f747c.jpg"},{"name":"The Little Man That Could","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219090/5ea2b235c4dc27fd11e9de1dedb30696f0c4ed6d.jpg"},{"name":"A Clergy Crusade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219090/5ea2b235c4dc27fd11e9de1dedb30696f0c4ed6d.jpg"},{"name":"Fortified Assualt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219090/5ea2b235c4dc27fd11e9de1dedb30696f0c4ed6d.jpg"},{"name":"The Calvary Is Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219090/5ea2b235c4dc27fd11e9de1dedb30696f0c4ed6d.jpg"},{"name":"Killer Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219090/5ea2b235c4dc27fd11e9de1dedb30696f0c4ed6d.jpg"},{"name":"I Know What I'm Doing (Checkers)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219090/5ea2b235c4dc27fd11e9de1dedb30696f0c4ed6d.jpg"},{"name":"I Know What I'm Doing (Chess)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap